					"nextDialogs": [
						760490604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760490604,
					"content": "好听。我平时哼的旋律，原来你都记下来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490605,
					"content": "嘿嘿，因为你唱歌很好听嘛，我们有时会悄悄在旁边听上一会儿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490606,
					"content": "月灵们也听得入迷了。不知道它们有没有学会。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490607,
					"content": "说不定，以后还得多请你们教几次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490608,
					"content": "来吧，把手给我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490609,
					"content": "欸？我们这是无偿演出，不用收学费的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490610,
					"content": "嗯？学费？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490611,
					"content": "我只是觉得，好听的旋律，应该有美丽的月光相伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490701,
					"content": "愉快的乐调…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490702
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760490702,
					"content": "结束了？感觉都还没听够…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490703,
					"content": "我曾说过这是我唯一记得的「摇篮曲」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490704,
					"content": "尽管还没找到其中的意义，但听你弹过之后，我开始觉得在月亮上等待着我的那个答案，至少是美好的。",
